00:06:40.435 --> 00:06:43.172
<v Host>Quiz time. Three questions.

00:06:43.771 --> 00:06:50.971
<v Slow>ワールドカップで、日本はブラジルに何対何で負けましたか。

00:06:51.771 --> 00:06:58.036
<v Host>In the World Cup, by what score did Japan lose to Brazil? Answer: One to two.

00:06:58.636 --> 00:07:06.267
<v Slow>近鉄京都線は、いつ全線で運転を再開しましたか。

00:07:07.067 --> 00:07:13.956
<v Host>When did the Kintetsu Kyoto Line resume service on the whole line? Answer: On the morning of the thirtieth.

00:07:14.555 --> 00:07:23.124
<v Slow>気象庁は、九州の南で何に警戒するよう呼びかけていますか。

00:07:23.923 --> 00:07:30.572
<v Host>What is the weather agency urging people in southern Kyushu to guard against? Answer: Landslides.

00:07:31.172 --> 00:07:43.555
<v Host>That's today's Japanese Daily News. Full transcript with furigana at podcast.jpnotes.dev. Subscribe on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. See you tomorrow.

